Cell["\<\
Here, the Kibble-Zurek scaling is illustrated for the Kitaev model (Kitaev, \
2003). See Sengupta et al. (2008) and Mondal et al. (2008) for details.\
\>", "TechNoteText",
 CellID->1617104745,ExpressionUUID->"7de07d25-1f81-4291-ad35-ded11ac541fe"]
}, Open  ]],

